%% v1.59.0 — Settle Fines With Savings
%% Two entry points (Treasurer-direct / member-request) funnel into one
%% shared review-and-settle core, mirroring v1.58.0's Savings-to-Capital
%% Conversion. Nothing moves until the non-initiating party reviews it.
flowchart TD

    A1[Treasurer / Assistant Treasurer\nopens 'Settle With Savings'\npicks a member] --> B[Sees member's live savings balance\nSelects individual OUTSTANDING fines\nRunning deduction total updates live]
    A2[Member opens\n'Settle With My Savings'\non their own outstanding-fines banner] --> B

    B --> C{"POST /fines/settlements (Treasurer)\nor /fines/settlements/request (member)"}
    C --> D[prepareSettlement:\nfines belong to this member?\nall still OUTSTANDING?]
    D -->|No| D1[Rejected]
    D -->|Yes| E{Every selected fine's currency\n== Savings account currency?}
    E -->|No| E1["Rejected: no automatic FX conversion\n(same rule as v1.57.1 / v1.58.0)"]
    E -->|Yes| F{Selected total <= member's\nsavings principal_balance?}
    F -->|No| F1[Rejected: cannot settle\nmore than they have saved]
    F -->|Yes| G{Who initiated?}

    G -->|Treasurer entered it| H1[savings_fine_settlements row\nsource=TREASURY_DIRECT\nstatus=PENDING_CONFIRMATION\nNOTHING has moved yet]
    G -->|Member requested it| H2[savings_fine_settlements row\nsource=MEMBER_REQUEST\nstatus=PENDING_APPROVAL\nNOTHING has moved yet]

    H1 --> I1[Member notified:\nconfirm or reject]
    H2 --> I2[Treasurer/Assistant Treasurer\nnotified: approve or deny]

    I1 --> J1{Member's decision}
    J1 -->|Reject| K1["PATCH .../reject\nstatus=REJECTED\nTreasurer notified — nothing ever moved"]
    J1 -->|Confirm| L["PATCH .../confirm or .../approve\n(ownership / permission re-checked)"]

    I2 --> J2{Treasurer's decision}
    J2 -->|Deny| K2["PATCH .../deny\nstatus=REJECTED\nMember notified — nothing ever moved"]
    J2 -->|Approve| L

    L --> M[settleFineSettlement — re-checks\nfine status + savings balance\nagain, at settle time]
    M -->|Fine no longer outstanding,\nor balance since dropped| M1[Rejected]
    M -->|Still valid| N["Leg 1 — one SAVINGS DEBIT for\nthe combined total\ninflow_type: SAVINGS_FINE_SETTLEMENT_OUT (GL 2100)"]
    N --> O[savings_balances.principal_balance\ndecremented once]
    O --> P["Leg 2 — clearFine() reused,\nonce per selected fine\n(same core as Clear Fine / FINE_PAYMENT ack)"]
    P --> Q[Each fine: status=PAID\nits own FINE_PAYMENT_IN credit transaction]
    Q --> R[savings_fine_settlements row\nstatus=SETTLED\nlinks the savings debit + every fine credit]
    R --> S[Whoever did NOT just act\nnotified: settlement posted]

    style D1 fill:#fee2e2
    style E1 fill:#fee2e2
    style F1 fill:#fee2e2
    style M1 fill:#fee2e2
    style K1 fill:#fef9c3
    style K2 fill:#fef9c3
    style R fill:#dcfce7
